{"title": "Don't Quit Yet", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["Lost a few trades, and thinking about giving up? Don't quit yet.", "Stop quitting after three losses. Learn from them instead.", "Nobody tells you losing trades are part of learning."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop quitting after three losses. Learn from them instead.", "text": "Don't quit yet", "chart": 0, "win": [29, 124], "show": 99}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Losses are part of learning", "vo": "Losing trades are a normal part of learning. Each one can teach you something.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Where's the stop?", "vo": "Take this one. You buy as the price bounces off support. Where does the stop belong?", "win": [29, 124], "options": ["A hair below the entry, to lose as little as possible", "Just below the support, outside the usual noise", "Far below, so it is never hit"], "answer": 1, "show": 99, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 41.8, "label": "Support", "tone": "level"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 41.85, "label": "Entry", "tone": "entry"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Just below support", "vo": "Just below the support. A stop a hair below the entry was hit after one candle. That's a lesson, not a reason to quit.", "win": [29, 124], "reveal_to": 124, "carry": true, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 41.69, "label": "Below support", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 41.82, "label": "Tight", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 40.8, "label": "Wide", "tone": "stop"}]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Real money hurts more", "vo": "With real money, losses hurt more, and people quit before they've had the chance to improve.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Built for practice", "vo": "On Meme Street, run out of practice money and you can restart free, once a week. Plus a two-minute Daily Chart, streaks, and free lessons.", "items"